## Summary

**You don't have to change anything to upgrade to v2.5.**

But you can take advantage of:
- Pattern matching (cleaner code)
- Async/await (better async)
- Break/continue (clearer loops)
- Generics (reusable code)
- Try operator (less boilerplate)

**Happy coding!**

